Local Guide · 359 ulasan · 1.288 foto','*scroll down for English review*

Direkomendasi lewat Reddit pas cari cafe recommended di Bandung. Staffnya friendly dan bersedia menjelaskan beans/menunya. Menunya cukup bervariasi, dari espresso-based, pourover, non-coffee, dessert etc. Filter coffeenya harum dan flavourful, ada kartu informasinya juga. Overall semua item yang kita pesan sangat enak, cheesecakenya lembut dan creamy. Hanya matcha lattenya saja yang agak terlalu manis. Interiornya cozy dan minimalis, pas untung hangout santai. Recommended buat pecinta kopi.

——————-

Was looking for good cafe in Bandung and Reddit brought us to Contrast Coffee. Great drink menu and bean variety, friendly and knowledgeable staff. Filter coffee comes with a information card on the bean you picked. The coffee drinks were really great, but the matcha latte was a bit too sweet. Cheesecake was also good and creamy. Interior was cozy and minimalist.
