Local Guide · 1.120 ulasan · 11.970 foto','Compact-sized coffee shop yang berlokasi di kawasan Blok M namanya @whatelse.coffee. Suasana disini cukup tenang dan nyaman, cocok untuk jadi tempat kerja sambil menikmati berbagai beverages enak.',4,'7 bulan lalu',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-21 09:22:53.621998+07','Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210bVEzazBWRk5KVDNaVWFsZFVTVU0wVUUxNmRGRRAB',0.90,'{WFH / Produktif}','{"suasana": "positif", "fasilitas_kerja": "positif", "kopi_dan_makanan": "positif"}','Suasana tenang, nyaman, cocok untuk kerja sambil menikmati minuman enak.',true),
	 ('25ad9ddc-e5c2-4ba5-9946-45754e8750b1'::uuid,'0b8be8c0-37c1-4e97-a294-1bbd87862ebb'::uuid,'Jeremy Subiakto
10 ulasan · 5 foto','Hidden gem alert near Blok M!

WhatElse Cafe hits different—super accessible, cuma jalan dikit dari MRT, dan ambience-nya calm banget. Perfect spot for remote working, quick lunch break, or chill ngopi sambil scrolling Notion.

I tried their Hot Latte—bold, creamy, with that signature Australian-style roast profile. Rich but balanced. Honestly, bisa ngalahin beberapa specialty coffee shops di sekitaran Jaksel.

For the food, I ordered Chicken Tare Teri (aka chicken dengan tartar sauce twist). Fusion banget—Japanese meets European comfort food. The grilled chicken was juicy, properly charred, and the sauce? Umami bomb! Ada coleslaw dan veggie tempura di sampingnya, jadi tetap ada balance dari tekstur dan freshness-nya.

Vibes? 10/10.
Taste? Surprisingly complex.
Price point? Still masuk akal buat Jaksel lunch budget.

Definitely coming back for the croissants next!!!!
Makanan: 5
Layanan: 4
Suasana: 5',5,'9 bulan lalu',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-21 09:22:53.621998+07','Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5V2RGSjNRalptVkhCTU1HRlVVVkl4Y1ZNeFFYYxAB',1.00,'{Hidden Gem,WFH / Produktif}','{"suasana": "positif", "fasilitas_kerja": "positif", "kopi_dan_makanan": "positif"}','Hidden gem, cocok kerja, kopi & makanan enak, suasana calm, harga masuk akal.',true),
